# Keep line endings predictable: the repo is developed on Windows but the core is
# portable, and the .bat/.vbs launchers in platforms/ are ASCII-only on purpose.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.vbs text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.lock binary
